  "details": "Currently we can turn the cameras on, which is nice. \n\nBut there's no bindings to take a photo.\n\nDifferent ideas of bindings:\n\n1) Simple \"Take Photo\" binding that would take 1 photo (would work only if the camera is on) \n\n.\n\n2) \"Power Binding\" that would also take a photo, \n\nBut first: turn the camera on if it was off\n\n(and turn it back off after the photo if it was off to start with when the key was pressed)\n\n.\n\n3) Multiple Photos binding: \n\nlike 2) , but would take n successive rafale photos.\n\n.\n\n4) Multiple Photos binding with interval: \n\nlike 3), but with an xx seconds pause between photos.\n\n.\n\nThat way we would have a simple one key click to trigger photos as needed without having to open the menu , turn on the camera, grab the camera, trigger photos ..\n\nIt would be nice if the 2 \"multiple photos\" features could be added to the regular camera menu too overall. :)",
